    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Transfer API allows for the efficient management of loyalty points transfers between hotels and their customers. By utilizing this endpoint, businesses can update and replace existing loyalty points records, ensuring that customer balances reflect the most accurate data. This API is primarily used by hotel management systems and customer loyalty platforms to facilitate seamless customer transactions and enhance loyalty program operations. Use cases include correcting points allocations, processing customer reward redemptions, and resolving discrepancies in loyalty accounting.",
